<title>USA: Investor buys stake in Home Financial Bancorp.</title>
<headline>Investor buys stake in Home Financial Bancorp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Lannon, an Indiana investor said Wednesday he holds a 6.3 percent stake in Home Financial Bancorp or 32,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Lannon said he bought his stake between July 6 and July 10 at prices ranging from $10.00 to $10.50 per share.</p>
<p>He holds the stake for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
